{"task_id": "runner-001", "difficulty": "hard", "attempt": 2, "response": null, "schema_valid": false, "raw": "{\"action\":\"final\",\"result\":\"Comprehensive 3D Endless Runner Prototype Architecture Plan for Godot 4.7.2:\\n\\n1. Scene Structure & Node Hierarchy:\\n- Main.tscn (Node3D)\\n  ├── DirectionalLight3D & WorldEnvironment (ProceduralSkyMaterial, volumetric fog disabled for mobile perf)\\n  ├── Player (CharacterBody3D, layer 1) -> CollisionShape3D (CapsuleShape3D), MeshInstance3D, RayCast3D (ground detection)\\n  ├── CameraMount (Node3D) -> Camera3D (fixed forward offset Z=+6.0, Y=+4.0, pitch -20 deg, following player with lerp smoothing)\\n  ├── TrackManager (Node3D) -> Handles chunk spawning, recycling, and forward movement\\n  ├── ObjectPool (Node) -> Pre-instantiates TrackSegment and Obstacle instances\\n  └── HUD (CanvasLayer)\\n      ├── Control (Anchor Full Rect)\\n      │   ├── ScoreLabel (Label)\\n      │   ├── DistanceLabel (Label)\\n      │   └── GameOverPanel (PanelContainer, hidden by default)\\n\\n2. Lane Switching & Movement System (Player.gd):\\n- 3 discrete lanes: LANE_WIDTH = 2.5 (Left = -2.5, Center = 0.0, Right = 2.5).\\n- Current lane index tracked as int [-1, 0, 1].\\n- Forward speed: constant baseline forward velocity along Z (or moving world chunks backwards towards -Z).\\n- Lateral switching: On lane input, target X is computed. Smooth lateral transition executed using `create_tween().set_trans(Tween.TRANS_QUAD).set_ease(Tween.EASE_OUT).tween_property(self, \\\"position:x\\\", target_x, 0.18)`.\\n- Vertical jump: standard impulse applied to `velocity.y` when `is_on_floor()`, integrated via `_physics_process(delta)` with standard gravity `ProjectSettings.get_setting(\\\"physics/3d/default_gravity\\\")`.\\n\\n3. Mobile Gesture & Touch Input (InputManager.gd):\\n- Processed in `_unhandled_input(event: InputEvent)`.\\n- Intercepts `InputEventScreenTouch` (records `touch_start_position` on `pressed = true`, computes swipe vector on `pressed = false`).\\n- Intercepts `InputEventScreenDrag` for responsive continuous swipe detection exceeding `SWIPE_THRESHOLD = 40.0` pixels.\\n- Gestures mapped: |dx| > |dy| (Swipe Left -> lane_left, Swipe Right -> lane_right); |dy| > |dx| (Swipe Up -> jump, Swipe Down -> slide/crouch).\\n\\n4. Object", "model": "gemini-3.8-flash", "judge": {"keep": false, "reason": "invalid tool/action schema"}, "accepted": false}
